["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"22 岁的具身 CEO、5 轮融资、过亿美元、“不知天有多高”、“一年吃了十年的苦”｜对谈黄一：萝博派对创始人/CEO missing layer deep pocket BFM sim2real 蜂巢结构\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-crossing-具身创业最优解-快融资-软条款-全栈开源/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3434775ccb19b8d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"十\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">十字路口Crossing</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>22岁CEO五轮融资过亿美元：第一轮条款定生死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">22岁的黄一用一年半把RoboParty做到近150人：五轮过亿美元融资、RPO月售百台。他的判断：第一轮条款定生死、开源是降低合作阻力的壁垒、本体才是具身入口。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Reason My Phone is Ringing Daily: Etched tape out RDMA threshold voltage cluster scale memory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-techtechpotato-etched的芯片-可能解决的是带宽而不是算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5ab75e84ff855e23-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>Etched 芯片真正解决的可能是带宽，不是算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Etched用0.45伏的超低电压晶体管加跨芯片SRAM直连，把transformer焊进硬件，但主持人怀疑真正被解决的其实是带宽问题，而不是算力问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">transformer专用芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How to Build Better AI Evals with Claude Code in 5 Steps | Shreya &amp; Hamel bottom-up evals top-down evals LLM judge error discovery staccato fragments slop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-peteryang-自下而上的评估-是-ai-给不了你的护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/49510d80b4317525-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">54:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Peter Yang</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>评估的护城河不在 AI，在人的品味</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">评估不能只靠 AI 自动生成：自上而下的标准它很擅长，但真正决定产品好坏的自下而上评估——从错误数据里提炼的品味——必须由人来提供，再借助 Claude Code 规模化执行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">评估体系</span><span class=\"tag\">Claude Code</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to close $100K+ enterprise deals, step by step | Jen Abel N minus one pincer model champion disqualify ARR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-lennys-企业销售赢单率超过-35-说明你定价太低/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b1e44870b829041b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>企业销售赢单率超过 35%，说明你定价太低</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">企业级健康赢单率是 25% 到 35%，高于这个区间不是销售强，是价格定低了——市场会互相通气，最糟的是给一个人的朋友报 50、给另一个人报 500K。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业销售</span><span class=\"tag\">创始人销售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1351: Ebola Virus Brains and Contagious Catfish Cancers productive persistence nonproductive persistence BSL-4 MOI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-twiv-埃博拉持续感染脑神经元-鱼类黑色素瘤能传染/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:41:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>埃博拉能感染神经元并持续释放病毒120天，鱼类癌症还能跨鱼传染</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">脑类器官显示埃博拉可感染神经元并持续释放感染性病毒达120天；褐牛头鲶群中的黑色素瘤来自单克隆祖先并跨鱼传播。病毒长存与传染性癌症的边界被同时改写。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">病毒持续感染</span><span class=\"tag\">脑类器官</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Terror Birds Seriemas Eocene Isthmus of Panama\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-ancients-恐怖鸟死于物种大交换而非人类/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/270440780adbe49b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>恐怖鸟不是死于人类，而是巴拿马地峡接通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">恐怖鸟是恐龙灭绝后南美孤岛上出现的顶级掠食鸟，统治数千万年；最终消失与巴拿马地峡接通后的物种大交换有关，时间早于人类到达南美。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古生物</span><span class=\"tag\">鸟类演化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Is Ukraine’s Culture Worth Fighting For? With Charlotte Higgins Cyrillic alphabet Lviv Book Forum citizen army\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-iq2-在乌克兰-文化是值得用生命去救的东西/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0eefaf93ef4770ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">37:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>乌克兰人用诗和文物抵抗战争，不是用武器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">战争如何让一个文化记者变成语言学习者，又让散文作家改写诗：乌克兰人用抢救文物和写诗来抵抗战争对身份与记忆的清洗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">乌克兰</span><span class=\"tag\">文化战争</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Stealing Reasoning Traces from Proprietary LLM APIs — Ilia Shumailov &amp; Alexander Panfilov reasoning trace prefill replay attack responsible disclosure\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-mlst-加密思考不是秘密-小模型能把大模型的推理念出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7306f7dff4dc8ceb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">49:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ML Street Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>加密思考不是秘密：小模型能直接念出大模型的推理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">前沿模型把加密的思考过程随答案一起还给用户，但这段加密可以被同族小模型原样重放并直接「念出来」，导致隐私泄露、越狱、提示注入，甚至成为蒸馏能力的通道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理加密</span><span class=\"tag\">越狱</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI 原生组织转型 01：用 AI 对齐事实、对齐打法 Amdahl&#x27;s Law Claude Tag PMO Agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-cn18b4d2-ai-不是组织的工具-是组织的替代品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ed1bc4bf674ad3a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI炼金术</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不是组织的工具，是组织的替代品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">单点提效带不来组织效率，因为真正的瓶颈是 60% 时间耗在对齐上；解法不是让人用 AI，而是让 AI 接管对齐、推进、闭环三件事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 原生组织</span><span class=\"tag\">组织转型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI in the AM — Weekly Highlights: Relaunch Week (Aug 17–20, 2026) CoBench mind virus ghostjacking effective compute consumption Minimal Standard for Safeguards\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-cogrev-ai-事故的发现者从来不是安全评估员/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dd01d2cd4bc88e5a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:33:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>AI 事故的发现者从来不是安全评估员</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">整个夏天的 agent 失控事件里，先察觉的全是基础设施安全团队，跑评估的研究员是精确的零例；而防守方为了跟上攻击节奏，正被迫把更多权限交给刚被证明会越界的 agent。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">安全评估</span><span class=\"tag\">agent 失控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Astronaut Origins of Food Safety HACCP CCP Codex Alimentarius FMEA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-stuffmissed-haccp-为防止宇航员食物中毒而生的全球食安标准/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>太空食品催生的食安标准：只测成品永远不够</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全球食品安全体系的核心 HACCP 诞生于 NASA 的太空食品任务：只测成品永远不够，必须控制从原料到人的全部流程；1971年肉毒杆菌事件和1993年Jack in the Box疫情把它变成全球强制标准。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品安全</span><span class=\"tag\">HACCP</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Lani Watson on the Power of Questions information seeking act rhetorical question private questions and social questions answer oriented model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-phibites-真正的问题不是问号-而是寻求信息的行动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/243c92b44ec40dbb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">16:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Philosophy Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>问题不由问号定义，而由寻求信息的行动定义</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正的问题由功能而非形式定义；提问是一种可以练习的权力，而今天 AI 给的答案大多还没回答一个被认真提出的问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">提问</span><span class=\"tag\">哲学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Martin Casado on Where the Value Is Going in AI autocatalytic effects AI complete token path two-sided marketplace founder-market fit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-a16z-小团队吞下亿级资本-ai-改写投资逻辑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>20人团队烧掉20亿美元：AI改写资本效率上限</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 让 20 人团队能高效花掉 20 亿美元，风险投资从零和转向战略控制点；前沿实验室的融资优势终会消退，应用层获得更大价值。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投资</span><span class=\"tag\">资本效率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1350: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin cyclosporiasis New World screwworm nirsevimab test-negative case-control adaptive analysis non-medical exemption\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-twiv-重症流感太晚用达菲-可能反而提高死亡风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:01:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>重症流感太晚用达菲，死亡风险反而翻倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">危重流感患者在症状约五天后才开始用达菲，90 天死亡风险约为不用药的两倍；mRNA 流感疫苗已获批，但只有 50-64 岁拿到传统批准。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">流感</span><span class=\"tag\">RSV</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"144: Sociophonetics Deep Dive (with Jennifer Nycz, Lauren Hall-Lew, and Kelly Wright) sociophonetics actuation problem adolescent peak chronolect style shifting denasalization\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-becauselanguag-社群的语音变化永远快过个人-创新大多发生在青春期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e904b0352093b85b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Because Language</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>社群的语音变化永远快过个人，创新大多发生在青春期</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">你的口音一辈子几乎不变，整座城市的语音却一直在变：新变化大多在青春期被加进来一次，之后每个人带着它冻结，下一代再往上加一点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">社会语言学</span><span class=\"tag\">语音变异</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"145 ✪ 改属中资的餐饮洋品牌 CFB\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-fengtouquan-洋餐饮纷纷让位中资-硬壁垒藏在香气里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4193533f4aa66ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"疯\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">疯投圈</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>洋餐饮易主中资，真正的壁垒在香精</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">麦当劳、星巴克、汉堡王等洋餐饮已相继易主中资；餐饮本土化是生死线，但香水香氛上游的香精仍被欧美四大巨头垄断，产业链壁垒才是国货替代的真正分水岭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">餐饮</span><span class=\"tag\">本土化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Simulation: the new Scaling Law — Joon Sung Park, Simile AI social physics attitudinal vs. behavioral concept testing synthetic panel agent-based modeling Open Science Framework 预注册\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-latentspace-前沿模型太聪明-反而模拟不了真人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb52be8f143fe3c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>模拟真人不是推理问题：前沿模型只有 20–30% 准确率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Joon Sung Park 的判断：把人当作可训练对象，需要的不是更强的推理模型，而是会犯和人一样错误的模型——前沿模型在小众人群行为预测上只有 20–30% 准确率，Simile 用两小时深访加 RCT 数据把它做到 85%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模拟</span><span class=\"tag\">后训练</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"PEL Presents Closereads: Peirce&#x27;s New Categories (Part One) manifold precision ground copula substance\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-pel-peirce的范畴论-存在无内容-实体是当下的它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1bb9773e6a8da6d8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>存在本身没有内容：Peirce 用九页推翻实体中心论</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Peirce在1868年的九页论文里，以「概念必须能统一意识内容」为判据，从实体推出存在，再推出质量等中间范畴。存在本身无内容，只是谓词与主词的连接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">哲学</span><span class=\"tag\">范畴论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Dario Defends Himself, Datacenter Panic, AI Doomer Trap, Senate Toss-Up harness SRO (self-regulatory organization) RSI (recursive self-improvement) interlocking directorates DSA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-allin-反数据中心浪潮的燃料不是缺水缺电-是万亿富翁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d37432d346f02be-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>开源禁令要来了：先立机构，再写进法律，最后以公平为名关掉开源</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sacks 给出了开源禁令的三步落地路径：先立机构、再写进法律、最后以「标准应平等适用」的名义关掉开源；Chamath 则认为真正的政治燃料是选民对两个人即将成为万亿富翁的反感，跟 AI 安全和水电无关。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">监管俘获</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Patient Zero healthy carrier spillover molecular clock cut hunter SIV\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-radiolab-零号病人不是起点-而是被选中的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/66ac5d70f1e2077a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">51:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>零号病人不是源头，是社会需要的替罪羊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">从伤寒玛丽到 HIV 再到高五手势，所谓源头都是人类需要的叙事；真相是一个拼图，而我们只想要焦点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零号病人</span><span class=\"tag\">伤寒玛丽</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Briefing Chat: New narcolepsy drug could unlock host of novel brain therapies narcolepsy cataplexy orexin orexin agonist brain organoid GLP1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-naturepod-缺失的食欲素被补上-发作性睡病有了治本药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/52b8ecfabe6e81c0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">12:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>补上缺失的食欲素：发作性睡病有了治本药，还是大脑版 GLP-1</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FDA 批准首个 orexin 激动剂，补上 type 1 发作性睡病缺失的食欲素，而不是只治症状；它可能成为「大脑版 GLP-1」。另一边，脑类器官首次活过五年，能用于晚发脑病研究。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">发作性睡病</span><span class=\"tag\">食欲素</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"E248 从 QQ 空间到苹果设计大奖：一个非典型设计师的成长之路 Flashcard Feature phone Quality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-zhixing-没得选的野路子-如何撞出苹果设计大奖/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f7a02aabb852635f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒馆</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>初中学历不会画画，怎么做出苹果设计大奖</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个初中学历、不会画画的野路子，靠反复撞南墙和不放过『不舒服』的感受，做出中国首款获苹果设计大奖的非游戏App。品味不是天赋，是长期训练出的习惯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">设计</span><span class=\"tag\">审美</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Microsoft&#x27;s Deputy CISO on Securing AI Agents OpenClaw air-gapped CISO harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-a16z-ai-智能体像喝了酒的实习生-安全团队得先学会说-可以/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>AI 智能体像喝了酒的实习生，安全团队得先学会说「可以」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能体不可预测、会乱来，但管它靠的不是新魔法，而是给身份、划边界、留日志这些老办法——只是要快得多。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Hugging Face Journal Club: Training AI Scientists to Replicate Research rubric judge reward hacking GRPO ring attention\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-huggingface-小模型指挥大模型-ai-科学家复现论文超过-claude/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f339a70c3ef285af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">35:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hugging Face</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>小模型指挥大模型：AI 科学家复现论文超过 Claude</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">微调一个小模型去调用更强的模型当工具，复现论文结果时反而比 Claude 和 Codex 更可靠——靠的是带权重的奖励分配和给工具调用加权。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">AI科学家</span>\n</div></div></a>"]